0 FILE 10218 - Blue House 3 Upstairs.ldr
0 Upper floor of the blue house with sand-blue and black brick walls, an arch, spindled fence, glazed windows, a dark-green curved feature and a dark-red sloped section, furnished with a goblet and inverted dish under tiled trim
